OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 27 Sep to Tue 6 Oct
OL,6,FChangeable as Atlantic frontal systems
OL,7,Fbring spells of rain, showers and
OL,8,Foccasional strong winds. The wettest
OL,9,Fand windiest conditions are most
OL,10,Flikely across Scotland and Northern
OL,11,FIreland, but wet and windy weather may
OL,12,Fextend more widely across England and
OL,13,FWales at times. Between systems,
OL,14,Fperiods of drier and more settled
OL,15,Fweather are likely, especially in the
OL,16,Fsouth and east. More widely dry and
OL,17,Fmore settled conditions could develop
OL,18,Fthrough the first week of October.
OL,19,FTemperatures are expected to be
OL,20,Fslightly above normal overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
