OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1790088492
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 7 Oct to Wed 21 Oct
OL,6,FPerhaps a spell of mainly dry and
OL,7,Fsettled weather at the start of this
OL,8,Fperiod. Thereafter, conditions will
OL,9,Fprobably turn more changeable further
OL,10,Finto October. Wet and windy conditions
OL,11,Fbecome more likely, with a risk of
OL,12,Fdeep areas of low pressure moving
OL,13,Facross the UK. Temperatures will
OL,14,Fprobably be above normal overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
